{"1935810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Diamond Hunt", "steam_appid": 1935810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/dbb5249145e3d48b9bab216ac12edd4f.avif?t=1787853375\" width=753 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The End Where It All Began. In the future, Earth has become uninhabitable due to a devastating war. Humanity was forced to abandon its home planet and move to other planets and worlds in search of new resources to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/fb488829c79979b024e7d8b1b52e2e09.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/fb488829c79979b024e7d8b1b52e2e09.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/fb488829c79979b024e7d8b1b52e2e09.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/88ea83c88078a32f306bc222bdf2ee43.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends will take on the role of space travelers who must explore different worlds, gather resources, and fight off—and sometimes become—feast on—the monsters that inhabit these worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/b24609e9adee6e1df154d519fbc4721c.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/b24609e9adee6e1df154d519fbc4721c.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/b24609e9adee6e1df154d519fbc4721c.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/207ceb0281a89db00ebfa6173c9d05cf.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In space, each world is unique and has its own characteristics and resources. From desert dunes to snowy wastelands or colorful forests, each planet is unique and harbors valuable resources and serious dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/9a48a1af263349e42d059fca24cb1a1f.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/9a48a1af263349e42d059fca24cb1a1f.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/9a48a1af263349e42d059fca24cb1a1f.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/a5b32cdb464f3b896d5b962639d36cf4.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance with your friends, fool around, and scream at the top of your lungs when a monster attacks your comrade. It's fun! Complete your mission objectives by exploring unique dungeons and try not to die together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/7bf9ea1249e3be47f745a1521f5b49e9.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/7bf9ea1249e3be47f745a1521f5b49e9.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/7bf9ea1249e3be47f745a1521f5b49e9.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/192364b5fd93989978047e6a4b517bdc.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spaceship to visit new and distant worlds. Collect resources to sell, purchase new, powerful equipment, or consumables for expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/4188bb309bf67a57c10a1a7fd252a12d.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/4188bb309bf67a57c10a1a7fd252a12d.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/4188bb309bf67a57c10a1a7fd252a12d.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your friends and embark on a thrilling journey across the vast expanse of space, where you'll have to survive, cooperate, and explore dungeons while interacting with the environment and aggressive fauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/dbb5249145e3d48b9bab216ac12edd4f.avif?t=1787853375\" width=753 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The End Where It All Began. In the future, Earth has become uninhabitable due to a devastating war. Humanity was forced to abandon its home planet and move to other planets and worlds in search of new resources to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/fb488829c79979b024e7d8b1b52e2e09.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/fb488829c79979b024e7d8b1b52e2e09.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/fb488829c79979b024e7d8b1b52e2e09.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/88ea83c88078a32f306bc222bdf2ee43.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to three friends will take on the role of space travelers who must explore different worlds, gather resources, and fight off—and sometimes become—feast on—the monsters that inhabit these worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/b24609e9adee6e1df154d519fbc4721c.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 h