/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/7bf9ea1249e3be47f745a1521f5b49e9.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/7bf9ea1249e3be47f745a1521f5b49e9.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/7bf9ea1249e3be47f745a1521f5b49e9.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/192364b5fd93989978047e6a4b517bdc.avif?t=1787853375\" width=780 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spaceship to visit new and distant worlds. Collect resources to sell, purchase new, powerful equipment, or consumables for expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/4188bb309bf67a57c10a1a7fd252a12d.poster.avif?t=1787853375\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/4188bb309bf67a57c10a1a7fd252a12d.webm?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1935810/extras/4188bb309bf67a57c10a1a7fd252a12d.mp4?t=1787853375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your friends and embark on a thrilling journey across the vast expanse of space, where you'll have to survive, cooperate, and explore dungeons while interacting with the environment and aggressive fauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", 